<div class="panel span8" id="mech-policy">
  <h2>{{ t('Policy Tape', '政策磁带') }}
    {{ help('Policy impulse (政策冲量) is a deterministic read from the policy_transmission lobe. Channels are the transmission mechanisms active. Events are sourced from the append-only data/china_policy_transmission/events.jsonl ledger (PBoC, State Council, CSRC, NDRC, MoF, Politburo, CEWC). Staleness per source is disclosed (CN-SYS-R4).', '政策冲量为来自政策传导脉络的确定性读取。渠道为当前激活的传导机制。事件来源于只追加的data/china_policy_transmission/events.jsonl台账（央行、国务院、证监会、发改委、财政部、政治局、中央经济工作会议）。每来源数据时效已披露（CN-SYS-R4）。') }}
